\subsection{Within-Generation Early Warning (Claim 2)}

\paragraph{ROC analysis.} Table~\ref{tab:auroc} presents within-generation AUROC for discriminating contaminated from clean training runs at any point during a single generation, using clustered bootstrap with 30 clusters.

\begin{table}[t]
\centering
\small
\caption{Within-generation AUROC for collapse detection. 1.5B values use 5-seed clustered bootstrap; PubMed uses 3-seed. \textbf{Bold}: effective detectors (AUROC $>$ 0.85).}
\label{tab:auroc}
\begin{tabular}{lcccc}
\toprule
Signal & 0.5B & 1.5B [95\% CI] & PubMed & Verdict \\
\midrule
Stable rank & 0.984 & \textbf{0.97} [.94,.99] & \textbf{0.95} & Early det. \\
Train.\ loss & 0.923 & \textbf{0.91} [.87,.94] & \textbf{0.89} & Early det. \\
Perplexity & 0.534 & 0.55 [.48,.62] & 0.53 & Fails \\
Spectral ent. & 0.58 & 0.63 [.55,.71] & 0.60 & Late \\
