\subsection{Cross-Domain Validation}

PubMed validation confirms that signal behavior generalizes beyond WikiText-2. Table~\ref{tab:cross-domain} compares generation-4 values at 100\% contamination. Signal direction consistency between WikiText and PubMed is 10/11 (gradient norm is the sole exception, at 25\% contamination in the biomedical domain).

\begin{table}[t]
\centering
\small
